0172:  * - SVG element (not HTML Canvas) per ui-spec.md
0173:  * - All rendering goes through Paper abstraction layer
0174:  * - Generic rendering algorithms (no special cases for fixed elements)
0175:  * - Will support pan/zoom viewport transformations in Phase 6
0176:  * - Elements rendered using principle-based algorithms (Constitution Principle IV)
